Grafana Mimir Installation Plan:

Step 1   Add Grafana Helm repository
Step 2   Create AWS S3 bucket
Step 3   Create IAM policy for Mimir S3 access
Step 4   Create IAM Role for Mimir
Step 5   Create Mimir ServiceAccount with IRSA
Step 6   Create Mimir Helm values
Step 7   Install Mimir
Step 8   Verify all pods
Step 9   Verify Mimir gateway
Step 10  Create Internal NLB
Step 11  Test remote_write endpoint

